\n○小坂橋ガク、18歳、一人称:俺\nさくやにだけ敬語です、キングが抜けた後は目の色がグリーンです\n呼びかけの名前は、中野渡さん、すずちゃん、キング\n\n○パンプキング、カボチャの雌花です、一人称:我\n尊大な感じでしゃべります\n呼びかけの名前は、中野渡、すずちゃん、ガクくん\n\n作品は、あまゆきさんの作画であることとアカウント名を明記して、私のsns (ブルースカイ、X)ににてご紹介させていただければと思います。\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 899508, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "よしお", "screen_name": "scomsio", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F1643ff31-9fe7-49c5-a8d6-74e745d202d0.png%3Fsensitive%3Dtrue?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/a2332b22-d895-43ee-8c7f-713a5d903a09.png", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": 77, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 21, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 1119961, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "サクラザワ✿", "screen_name": "sakuracandy123", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1511565185470775298/_ovKaPQS.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1326532204286013441/1784295892/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 144}, {"id": 2004064, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "永。サブ(フォロバ不要。)", "screen_name": "nagamaru_mini", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1518798896473853952/JOgtRFV0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1512977860902141953/1739345603/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_ran